From b6a62b66ea9708be1be4fa915362c24d70e60161 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:33:47 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Lyrics: hide status & gesture bars setting; face-to-face
 reactions on the seam

- New "Hide status & gesture bars in lyrics" toggle (Player & Lyrics settings,
  on by default). While lyrics are open and the player is expanded, both system
  bars are hidden in portrait, landscape and face-to-face; they return when
  lyrics close. Sheets opened from lyrics keep them hidden too.
- Landscape face-to-face: positive reactions sit at the top middle and open
  downward; negative reactions sit at the bottom middle and open upward.
  ReactionCorner gains expandDownward.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EzyBeBJGG55RsMKWmRWTnP
